  <h2>Notice and repair errors</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="in" data-hint="The sentence gives an exact clock time, which requires the point preposition." data-fix="I start work at nine o’clock." data-why="A clock time is a point, so it takes at.">
